usage
=====

enable the service:

  ln -s /etc/sv/dropbear /var/service

host keys are generated on first connection (-R). the port and extra
options are set in /etc/dropbear/config:

  DROPBEAR_PORT=22
  DROPBEAR_EXTRA_ARGS="-w -g"    disable root logins
  DROPBEAR_EXTRA_ARGS="-s"       disable password logins

restart the service after editing: sv restart dropbear

don't enable it together with openssh's sshd on the same port.
